1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,835
Two thousand seven hundred tons of real sand, in the middle of Las Vegas.

2
00:00:04,885 --> 00:00:08,990
That is the beach at the Mandalay Bay, and hotel guests get in free.

3
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:14,680
Eleven acres of beach and water, with a wave pool and a lazy river through the palm trees.

4
00:00:14,730 --> 00:00:19,890
Expedia lists towels, loungers, and umbrellas, plus cabanas if you want more space.

5
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:23,965
Then, eighteen restaurants and a casino, all on the same property.

6
00:00:24,015 --> 00:00:29,480
Guests agree: more than nineteen thousand verified reviews give it eight point six out of ten.

7
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:31,565
The beach is seasonal, so check your dates.

8
00:00:31,615 --> 00:00:34,900
The full tour is on my channel.
